  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prioritizing and Reforming Agri-Food System Policies (MAFAP III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase III of the Monitoring and Analyzing Food and Agricultural Policies (MAFAP) programme will build on the expertise, reputation and country buy-in gained in Phase II, to incorporate policy prioritization for inclusive agricultural transformation in its approach, drive forward an additional 30 food and agricultural policy reforms across 8 partner countries in Sub-Saharan Africa, and strengthen the programme&apos;s internal and external institutionalization.</narrative>
  </description>
